    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/579c72b19836faae91a6e32e4fb7ff18.poster.avif?t=1738950994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/579c72b19836faae91a6e32e4fb7ff18.webm?t=1738950994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/579c72b19836faae91a6e32e4fb7ff18.mp4?t=1738950994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Some dark magic has taken possession of a teenage witch's backpack and all of its books.<br><br>Panels is a puzzle platformer with a dash of metroidvania and a unique panel switching mechanic.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/3e7d88f7661e7b71270e39c658664814.webp?t=1738950994\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/38c1d22e14c8c255e3b6c8ca8622121f.poster.avif?t=1738950994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/38c1d22e14c8c255e3b6c8ca8622121f.webm?t=1738950994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/38c1d22e14c8c255e3b6c8ca8622121f.mp4?t=1738950994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/a8b200e5837a9b45a88440b9e2890511.webp?t=1738950994\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/78b94f1ed0d667b0040d45da22593c15.poster.avif?t=1738950994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/78b94f1ed0d667b0040d45da22593c15.webm?t=1738950994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/78b94f1ed0d667b0040d45da22593c15.mp4?t=1738950994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/a85e8151854ff4dffb239531ff426e9e.webp?t=1738950994\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/f425d7de4c1c833e5fa5a131b98e94fb.poster.avif?t=1738950994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/f425d7de4c1c833e5fa5a131b98e94fb.webm?t=1738950994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1541200/extras/f425d7de4c1c833e5fa5a131b98e94fb.mp4?t=1738950994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Gummy is an eraser. She can stick to walls, erase pencilled objects and interact with other stationery items. Help her fix the chaos that has taken over the school books.<br><br><i>This is a solo designer passion project made in his spare time with art from his wife. It may be slow going at times, but all the love is there\u2026 If you find Gummy deserves help finding her way\u2026 please wishlist.</i>",
